8
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:29.360
I love your book so much.

9
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.220
Wow, thank you so much.

10
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:32.610
That's so nice.

11
00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:37.610
I mean, this, I have been with this for some time now

12
00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:42.270
and it's Mother's Day and we're talking about moms

13
00:00:43.137 --> 00:00:46.660
and you just describe being a mother

14
00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:48.973
in a way that I don't often read.

15
00:00:49.822 --> 00:00:52.950
